// Cells (generated as one Ascii op), then SilPortRessac's stamps (games/silice/gfx/SilPortRessac.ron,
// original art). North: the cliff with the Tunnel de Verre's glass door (25, 3). The plaza (rows 4-8):
// the Taverne (an upturned hull, door (4, 7)), the rusty distributor (8, 7), the town sign (22, 5), the
// two container market stalls, the RHUM DE SAM neon (34, 6), container stacks. The silica dunes
// (x 1-17, rows 10-17: silica sand, dune grass = tall grass) with the blue container's pocket (x 3-7,
// rows 13-16: the container (6, 15) is pushed into (6, 14) to reach the Water Stone (4, 15)). The
// street (x 18-32), the container wall (x 33-34) and Crow's alley (x 35-47, rows 11-16, its mouth on the
// quay). The west containers (x 1-14, rows 18-19) with the four grunts' alcoves (13, 11, 9, 7; 19) over
// the one-tile corridor (row 20) to the cargo pier. The quay (rows 18-20) and its wooden edge (row 21).
// The cargo pier (x 2-3) and the gym pier (x 27-28) lead to wooden docks (row 26) under the two ships'
// boarding stairs (cargo (7, 25), Zenith-Grog (32, 25)); the gym sign (26, 20). The east jetty
// (x 40-47, rows 21-23), stone.
// The ground is silica sand everywhere: General's pale speckled ground (265).
// Route S5 (east, a connection) draws our east columns with ITS tilesets: x 42-49 hold primary
// metatiles only (silica sand, the rock spur closing the alley's north side (rows 9-10) and the east
// rock (x 48-49), the stone jetty), no SilPortRessac ones.
// The ships stand in a solid shoal (414, as round the Abandoned Ship on Route 108), so a stair is
// reached only from the dock cell below it (7, 26) or (32, 26), where the cargo's guard and the gangway
// pirate stand guard. Open sea (water, elevation 1, surfable from M10) everywhere else.
[
    Ascii(x: 0, y: 0, rows: [
        "^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^",
        "nnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnn",
        "fffffffffffffffffffffffffvffffffffffffffffffffffff",
        "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbDbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb",
